分区计算：
1 B in bit => 8 bit
1 KB in B => 1,024 B

1 MiB in KB => 1,024 KB
1 GiB in MiB=> 1,024 MiB


1 page = 2048 B
1 block = 64 page


1 page in KB => 2 KB
1 block in KB => 128 KB

1 MiB in block=> 8 block

10 block in MiB => 1.25 MiB

32 block in MiB => 4 MiB

0x20000 B in block => block
block
0x80000 B in block => 4*block

0x100000 B in block => 8*block

0x200000 B in block => 0x10*block

0x300000 B in block => 0x18*block

0x340000 B in block => 0x1A*block

0x1900000 B in block => 0xC8*block

0x4000000 B in block => 0x200*block

0x4340000 B in block => 0x21A*block

0x8000000 B in block => 0x400*block

0x1A in dec => 26

200 in hex=> 0xC8

225 in hex=> 0xE1

0x400 in dec=> 1,024

128 MiB in block=> 1,024 block

0x4400000 B in block => 0x220*block

0x220 in dec=> 544



原来 
26+200+798=> 1,024
26 block in MiB => 3.25 MiB
200 block in MiB=> 25 MiB
798 block in MiB=> 99.75 MiB

3.25 + 25 + 99.75=> 128
nand0: [0x0 ,0x340000]  block [0 ~ 25] 26
(0x340000 B - 0x0 B) in block => 0x1A*block

	4 + 4 + 8 + 8 => 24
	[0,3]: 4 block   [0,0x80000)         uboot-spl  0.5MiB
	[4,7]: 4 block   [0x80000,0x100000)  env        0.5MiB                
	[8,15]: 8 block  [0x100000,0x200000) uboot      1MiB
	[16,23]: 8 block [0x200000~0x300000)  rt-thread 1MiB~1.25MiB
   26 block in MiB=> 3.25 MiB
nand1: [0x340000, 0x1C40000]   block [26,225]  200
(0x1C40000 B - 0x340000 B) in block => 0xC8*block
   200 block in MiB=> 25 MiB
nand2: [0x1C40000, 0x8000000) block [226,1023] 798
	(0x8000000 B - 0x1C40000 B) in block=> 0x31E*block
	0x31E in dec=> 798
	798 block in MiB=> 99.75 MiB

新的：
32 + 200 + 792 => 1,024
32 block in MiB => 4 MiB
200 block in MiB=> 25 MiB
792 block in MiB=> 99 MiB
4 + 25 + 99 => 128

nand0:[0x0 ,0x400000]  block [0 ~ 31] 32
(0x400000 B - 0x0 B) in block => 0x20*block
32 block in MiB=> 4 MiB

	4+ 4 +8 + 16 => 32
	[0,3]: 4 block   [0,0x80000)         uboot-spl 0.5MiB
	[4,7]: 4 block   [0x80000,0x100000)  env       0.5MiB                
	[8,15]: 8 block  [0x100000,0x200000) uboot     1MiB
	[16,31]: 16 block[0x200000~0x400000) rt-thread 2MiB
	
nand1:[0x400000, 0x1D00000)      block [32,231] 200
(0x1D00000 B - 0x400000 B) in block => 0xC8*block

nand2: [0x1D00000, 0x8000000) block [232,1023] 792

(0x8000000 B - 0x1D00000 B) in block => 0x318*block
0x318 in dec => 792

原来的 nand0 只给分配了 26 个 block，留给 rt_thread.bin 的空间只有 8 个 Block(1 MiB)，程序变大了之后( build = debug 1.7MiB > 1.25MiB)，会越界写入到nand1 之中，程序启动后，初始化 nand1 ，会将程序擦除一部分，导致再次上电无法启动
调整 nand0 分区，给 app 部分 2MiB 空间，不会越界写入到 nand1
build=debug 1.7MiB
build=release 1.1MiB 
32 -16 +1 => 17

17 block in MiB => 2.125 MiB

新的 分配给了nand0 32 个 block ,rt_thread 占用 16~32 17 个 







